## Relx control requires a node name. Distribution is restricted to loopback
## and one port in the base release; a clustered deployment must replace these
## settings, provide an external cookie secret, and configure distributed
## stores explicitly. The Helm chart defaults to one replica.
-sname erlang_adk
-kernel shell_history disabled
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100
-kernel inet_dist_listen_max 9100
+Bd
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
